Use code with caution.
The application crashes with a NoSuchBeanDefinitionException looking for DataSource.
• Why did it crash, and how do you fix it using an annotation?
See Answer
It crashed because you only loaded SecurityConfig into the container. Spring has no idea DatabaseConfig exists. To fix it, add @Import(DatabaseConfig.class) at the top of the SecurityConfig class.

